            "school": "Transmutation",
            "level": "Cantrip",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "You point your finger toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that only you can hear.\n\nYou can cast this spell through solid Objects if you are familiar with the target and know it is beyond the barrier. Magical silen⁠ce, 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of c⁠ommon metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood blocks the spell. The spell doesn’t have to follow a straight line and can travel freely around corners or through openings.\n\nSpell Lists. Artificer, Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard",
