            "concentration": "No",
            "school": "Evocation",
            "level": "Level 1",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "As you hold your hands with thumbs touching and fingers spread, a thin sheet of flames shoots forth from your outstretched fingertips. Each creature in a 15-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes [[/r 3d6]] fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nThe fire ignites any flammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried.\n\nAt Higher Levels\n\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by [[/r 1d6]] for each slot level above 1st.\n\nSpell Lists. Sorcerer, Wizard",
