            "effect": "You hurl a 4-inch-diameter sphere of energy at a creature that you can see within range. You choose acid, cold, fire, lightning, poison, or thunder for the type of orb you create, and then make a ranged spell attack against the target. If the attack hits, the creature takes [[/r 3d8]] damage of the type you chose.\n\nAt Higher Levels\n\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by [[/r 1d8]] for each slot level above 1st.\n\nSpell Lists. Sorcerer, Wizard",
