            "effect": "Your spell bolsters your allies with toughness and resolve. Choose up to three creatures within range. Each target's hit point maximum and current hit points increase by [[5]] for the duration.\n\nAt Higher Levels\n\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, a target's hit points increase by an additional 5 for each slot level above 2nd.\nSpell Lists.  Artificer, Bard, Cleric, Paladin, Ranger",
