            "effect": "You touch a nonmagical weapon. Until the spell ends, that weapon becomes a magic weapon with a +1 bonus to Attack rolls and Damage Rolls.\n\nAt Higher Levels\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the bonus increases to +2. When you use a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the bonus increases to +3.\n\nSpell Lists. Artificer, Paladin, Ranger, Sorcerer, Wizard",
