            "school": "Evocation",
            "level": "Level 2",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "A shimmering green arrow streaks toward a target within range and bursts in a spray of acid. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes [[/r 4d4]] acid damage immediately and [[/r 2d4]] acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a miss, the arrow splashes the target with acid for half as much of the initial damage and no damage at the end of its next turn.\n\nAt Higher Levels\n\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage (both initial and later) increases by [[/r 1d4]] for each slot level above 2nd.\n\nSpell Lists. Wizard",
