            "school": "Transmutation",
            "level": "Level 3",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "A nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. For the duration, the weapon has a +1 bonus to attack rolls and deals an extra 1d4 damage of the chosen type when it hits.\n\nAt Higher Levels\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th or 6th level, the bonus to attack rolls increases to +2 and the extra damage increases to 2d4. When you use a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the bonus increases to +3 and the extra damage increases to 3d4.\n\nSpell Lists. Artificer, Druid, Paladin, Ranger",
