            "effect": "The next time you make a ranged weapon attack during the spell’s duration, the weapon’s ammunition, or the weapon itself if it’s a thrown weapon, transforms into a bolt of lightning. Make the attack roll as normal. The target takes [[/r 4d8]] lightning damage on a hit, or half as much damage on a miss, instead of the weapon’s normal damage.\n\nWhether you hit or miss, each creature within 10 feet of the target must make a Dexterity saving throw. Each of these creatures takes [[/r 2d8]] lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nThe piece of ammunition or weapon then returns to its normal form.\n\nAt Higher Levels\n\nWhen you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage for both effects of the spell increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd.\n\nSpell Lists. Ranger",
