            "school": "Necromancy",
            "level": "Level 5",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "Dark tendrils burst out from you in all directions. Creatures of your choice within must make a Constitution saving throw. On failure, they take 6d8 necrotic damage, and you can move them in a straight line to within 5 feet of you if there is an empty space they can be pulled to. On success, they take half as much damage and are not moved.\n\nYou regain hit points equal to one quarter (rounded down) of the necrotic damage taken by all targets effected by the spell.\n\nClasses: Warlock, Wizard",
