            "concentration": "No",
            "school": "Necromancy",
            "level": "Level 7",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "You send negative energy coursing through a creature that you can see within range, causing it searing pain. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. It takes 7d8 + 30 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nA humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a Zombie that is permanently under your comm⁠and, following your verbal orders to the best of its ability.\n\nSpell Lists.  Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard",
