            "school": "Necromancy",
            "level": "Level 8",
            "classes": "",
            "effect": "You draw the moisture from every creature in a 30-foot cube centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. Constructs and undead aren't affected, and plants and water elementals make this saving throw with disadvantage. A creature takes [[/r 12d8]] necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nNonmagical plants in the area that aren't creatures, such as trees and shrubs, wither and die instantly.\n\nSpell Lists. Sorcerer, Wizard",
